            "review_text": "Kraisan C\nBang Bo, Thailand1205 contributions\n1\nMy kids said \"it is the best dinner of this year!\"\nNov 2022\nWe preordered lobsters, crabs, mantis shrimp, oysters, octopus, etc. The cooking methods depend on you. However, we choose cooking Chef's table style. All of the dishes are impressive. The price is worth it compared to its quality and quantity.\n\nThe manager (Nguyen Minh Tuan) is very polite and helpful. This makes our dinner more impressive. And it is why we will return to this restaurant if we visit Phu Quoc next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 24, 2022\nDavid Nguyen\nThank you for sharing your experience with us. We're glad to know that you fully enjoyed your dinner at Crazy Crab. We wish you a happy day today and see you soon!\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
